            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i3 @ 3.0GHz or AMD equivalent.<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA®:  GeForce® GTX470, AMD:  Radeon R7 260X 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 6 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard or onboard chipset<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Compatible with XInput and DirectInput USB devices including gamepads and arcade sticks.  Xbox 360 Controller for Windows Recommended</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i3 @ 3.0GHz or AMD equivalent. / Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-11900 or AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA®： GeForce® GTX 660, AMD：Radeon RX 460 2GB / NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER、AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 12<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 6 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard or onboard chipset<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Compatible with XInput and DirectInput USB devices including gamepads and arcade sticks.  Xbox 360 Controller for Windows Recommended</li></ul>"
